> SPDEhowto.pdf of the vignettes (obtained by typing
> browseVignettes(package="INLA") in the R command line), i.e. what I
> was looking for was
>
> MODS$summary.hyperpar
>
> this gives all  hyperparamters, including those of the error (or
> residual) probability distributions (e.g., the power parameter of the
